    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Forge Bonds of Harmony</p></blockquote><p>The balm of peace thrives at the heart of healthy communities, between friendly nations, and in the souls of the kindhearted. The gods of peace inspire people of all sorts to resolve conflict and to stand up against the forces that would keep peace from flourishing. Clerics of the Peace Domain preside over the signing of treaties and are often asked to arbitrate disputes; their blessings draw people together and help them shoulder one another's burdens.</p><h4>Peace Domain Deities</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Example Deity</th><th>Pantheon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Angharradh</td><td>Elven</td></tr><tr><td>Berronar Truesilver</td><td>Dwarven</td></tr><tr><td>Boldrei</td><td>Eberron</td></tr><tr><td>Cyrrollalee</td><td>Halfling</td></tr><tr><td>Eldath</td><td>Forgotten Realms</td></tr><tr><td>Gaerdal Ironhand</td><td>Gnomish</td></tr><tr><td>Paladine</td><td>Dragonlance</td></tr><tr><td>Rao</td><td>Greyhawk</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><p><em>Its Divine Strike (Cleric level 8) is replaced by the Blessed Strikes of the 2024 Cleric.</em></p><h3>Peace Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.LJqGS6p7OcvVctcR]{Peace Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.cCCrzNyVxnfXngJ0]{Emboldening Bond}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.rrETPTWH4okrcUzx]{Implement of Peace}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.yJo97KdnSomKYiLm]{Balm of Peace}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.TrAki8Qq2maO4zfW]{Protective Bond}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.aqyxdfDXrNeykDPp]{Expansive Bond}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Peace Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAid0000000]{Aid}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHeroism000]{Heroism}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbSanctuary0000]{Sanctuary}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWardingBon]{Warding Bond}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBeaconofHo]{Beacon of Hope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSending000]{Sending}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.gvBaLNakzHXPur9F]{Aura of Purity}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplOtilukesRe]{Otiluke's Resilient Sphere}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterRes]{Greater Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRarysTelep]{Rary's Telepathic Bond}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
